      <segment>
        <source>Ordinary linear progress bar, supports position specification of additional areas</source>
        <target state="translated">普通線性進度條，支持指定附加區域的位置。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="34" name="VerticalStepsTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Vertical progress bar</source>
        <target state="translated">垂直步驟進度條</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="35" name="VerticalStepsDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Ordinary step progress bar, supports position specification of additional areas</source>
        <target state="translated">普通步驟進度條，支持指定附加區域的位置。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="36" name="ToggleDisabledStatusTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>toggle disabled status</source>
        <target state="translated">切換禁用狀態</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="37" name="ToggleDisabledStatusDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The progress bar is in the disabled state and uses the disabled style.</source>
        <target state="translated">進度條處於禁用狀態並使用禁用樣式。</target>
      </segment>
