      <segment>
        <source>ProgressBar, StepsProgressBar, CircleProgress, and DashboardProgress cover linear, stepped, circular, and dashboard progress indicators with status, size, gradient, and layout options.</source>
        <target state="translated">ProgressBar、StepsProgressBar、CircleProgress 和 DashboardProgress 覆蓋線性、步驟、環形與儀錶盤進度展示，並支持狀態、尺寸、漸變和佈局配置。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
